                <h3>BirdLife International</h3>
                <p>
                    Discover an international network dedicated
                    to protecting birds, biodiversity and important
                    natural habitats.
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.birdlife.org/"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    Explore initiatives ↗
                </a>
            </div>

        </div>

