                    environmental campaigns.
                </p>
                <a href="https://www.zeroplastic.lk/volunteers/"
                   target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    Check availability ↗
                </a>
            </div>

            <div class="opportunity-card">
                <span class="category">GLOBAL</span>
                <h3>Ocean Conservancy</h3>
                <p>
                    Discover international coastal clean-ups
                    and global initiatives addressing marine pollution.
                </p>
                <a href="https://oceanconservancy.org/trash-free-seas/international-coastal-cleanup/"
